  - image-analysis
abstract: >-
  FermiViewer is an interactive MATLAB GUI for analyzing electron
  microscopy images. It imports common instrument formats (Gatan
  DM3/DM4, FEI SER, Bruker BCF, MRC, generic TIFF/RAW) and provides
  measurements, FFT analysis, EELS background subtraction and edge
  identification, EDS multi-channel composite and Cliff-Lorimer
  quantification, and electron-diffraction indexing against a built-in
  crystal database. It requires only MATLAB built-ins — no external
  toolboxes — and was extracted from the quantized_matlab parent
  toolbox in 2026 to give the EM tooling a single-focus home.
